                                                "sense_id": "6457d28b-cc21-30b5-99aa-9e370ee60f94",
                                                "text": "2014, “Aldergrove’s 856 gang busted, $400,000 in drugs seized,” CBC News, 30 July, 2014,\nPolice say this 20 ton hydraulic jack was used to press mixtures of cocaine and “buff” into brick."
                                            }
                                        ]
